This Folder contains the SLURM job scripts for running the experiments on the
SLURM HUJI cluster [Note that where GPU is used, the script fits the Moriah cluster,
and may need to be modified for other clusters].

There is no real need to run the scripts in this folder, as they are specially designed
for the SLURM cluster, and are not general-purpose scripts. However, they can be used as a reference
for how to run the experiments on a SLURM cluster, and can be modified to fit other clusters as needed.

We used miniconda to create a virtual environment for running the experiments,
and created the environment using the `environment.yaml` file in the root of the repository.

For more details, instructions, and help with running the experiments, please contact the authors.